       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EXTATTR.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY BNK1MAI.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO BNK1MEO.
           MOVE 'COLOR TEST' TO MESSAGEO.
           MOVE X'F2' TO MESSAGEC.
           MOVE X'F4' TO MESSAGEH.
           EXEC CICS SEND MAP('BNK1ME') MAPSET('BNK1MAI')
             FROM(BNK1MEO) ERASE FREEKB END-EXEC.
           EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
